            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Light or dark, your choice

Cubby has always had a dark theme, but it only appeared when your whole Mac was
set to Dark. Now you can pick for Cubby alone in **Settings → General →
Appearance**: Match Mac, Light or Dark.

The panel, Settings, the preview and the markup editor all switch straight
away, with no restart.
]]></description>
